      "task_item": "",
      "content": "\n**Issue**: The create subtask must inherit project_id and profiles\n\n**Description**: When creating a subtask in ChatView.vue, the new subtask should automatically inherit the project_id and profiles from the parent task or current context.\n\n**Requirements**:\n- Subtask creation should automatically capture the current project_id\n- Subtask creation should automatically capture the current profiles\n- Pass these inherited values to the subtask creation form/component\n- Ensure inherited values are properly stored with the subtask\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- \u2705 New subtasks automatically have the correct project_id\n- \u2705 New subtasks automatically have the correct profiles\n- \u2705 Inherited values are persisted to the database\n- \u2705 No manual input required for project_id and profiles in subtask creation",
